{"version":1,"page":{"kind":"annotation-detail","href":"/shijing/annotation/017-xing-lu/wangli-yundu","dataHref":"/__data/shijing/annotation/017-xing-lu/wangli-yundu/data.json","title":"詩經韻讀 · 行露 · 注释总览","description":"風 · 召南 · 行露 · 汇集《詩經韻讀》关于《行露》的 2 条注释，含 2 条注脚。"},"payload":{"detail":{"route":{"poemId":"017-xing-lu","materialId":"wangli-yundu"},"href":"/shijing/annotation/017-xing-lu/wangli-yundu","poem":{"id":"017-xing-lu","title":"行露","categoryId":"feng","subcategoryId":"shaonan","path":["風","召南","行露"],"segments":[{"id":"seg-001","text":"厌浥行露","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-002","text":"岂不夙夜","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-003","text":"谓行多露","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-004","text":"谁谓雀无角","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-005","text":"何以穿我屋","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-006","text":"谁谓女无家","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-007","text":"何以速我狱","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-008","text":"虽速我狱","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-009","text":"室家不足","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-010","text":"谁谓鼠无牙","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-011","text":"何以穿我墉","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-012","text":"谁谓女无家","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-013","text":"何以速我讼","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-014","text":"虽速我讼","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-015","text":"亦不女从","isActive":false}]},"material":{"id":"wangli-yundu","title":"詩經韻讀","authors":["王力"],"contributorLine":"现代 · 王力","era":"现代","publicationYear":1980,"carrier":"PDF"},"stats":{"annotationCount":2,"glossCount":2},"annotations":[{"id":"0001","order":1,"total":2,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"《行露》韵读总说","targetNotes":"现存页图可见全篇。","sourceLabel":"第 17-18 页","sourceNotes":"书页 17-18《行露》全篇韵读。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0001-1","attributionLabel":"王力","sectionLabel":"韵读","text":"现存页图可见《行露》全篇。王力将首章“露(lak)”叠用并归铎部；第二章“角(keok)、屋(ok)、狱(ngiok)、足(tziok)”分别入觉、屋、沃诸部而成通押；第三章则以“牙(ngæ)”“家(kea)”与“墉(jiong)”“讼(ziong)”“从(dziong)”分见鱼、东诸部，显示这篇用韵兼有通协与转部。","notes":null}]},{"id":"0002","order":2,"total":2,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"厌浥行露，岂不夙夜？谓行多露。谁谓雀无角？何以穿我屋？谁谓女无家？何以速我狱？虽速我狱，室家不足。谁谓鼠无牙？何以穿我墉？谁谓女无家？何以速我讼？虽速我讼，亦不女从。","targetNotes":"现存页图可见部分。","sourceLabel":"第 17-18 页","sourceNotes":"书页 17-18《行露》全篇韵读。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0002-1","attributionLabel":"王力","sectionLabel":"韵读","text":"页图可读首章“露(lak)”两见并标铎部；第二章“角(keok)、屋(ok)、狱(ngiok)、足(tziok)”依次分入觉、屋、沃、屋部；第三章“牙(ngæ)”与“家(kea)”相协，“墉(jiong)、讼(ziong)、从(dziong)”又转入东部。由此可见《行露》在王力系统中并非单一部内押韵，而是保存了古诗通转的痕迹。","notes":null}]}]}}}
